    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThis is a consequence of 'mini.pairs' not designed to work with multibyte characters (`¿` and `¡` are multibyte).\n\nI've been planning to make it work, but the problem is doing it with as minimum performance overhead as possible. I'll eventually take a look at it.",
