        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on latest `main`.\n\nProfiling showed that using multibyte-aware `vim.fn.strcharpart()` instead of `string.sub()` only adds about 0.2 *micro*seconds of overhead, which should be totally fine.",
